# {{.Type}}: {{.Name}}

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

Use this data source to enumerate the active API keys for a service account — for example, to audit keys, alert on keys nearing their `expires_at`, or find keys that have never been used (`last_used_at == 0`) as candidates for cleanup.

~> **Note:** Only key metadata is returned. The raw key value is never retrievable after creation; to mint a new key use the `kosli_service_account_api_key` resource.

